,\\tau,F,x\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop7IrreducibleClosedSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop7IrreducibleClosedSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7SoberSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop7SoberSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}sober\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7SoberSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall F\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop7IrreducibleClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\to\\exists!x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,\\{x\\},F)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}sober\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7SoberSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall F\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop7IrreducibleClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\to\\exists!x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,\\{x\\},F)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The irreducible-closed predicate already enforces <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(F\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span>; the unique <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> is its generic point.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor"